  "id": "body-image-avoidance",
  "term": "body-image avoidance",
  "definition": "Body-image avoidance is the tendency to stay away from situations that trigger चिंता or discomfort about one’s appearance, such as mirrors, being weighed, certain clothing, or photographs. It is a behavioral sign of body image disturbance and is linked with body dissatisfaction and disordered eating.",
